+                Can be either:
+                    - A link to the `.ckpt` file (for example
+                      `"https://huggingface.co/<repo_id>/blob/main/<path_to_file>.ckpt"`) on the Hub.
+                    - A path to a *file* containing all pipeline weights.
+            torch_dtype (`str` or `torch.dtype`, *optional*):
